<title>UK: Bayerische LB sets 150 million Finnish markka bond.</title>
<headline>Bayerische LB sets 150 million Finnish markka bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merita Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN FIM   COUPON     5.26 PCT  MATURITY    22.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    22.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    UNLISTED  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
